 r←Test_DirSelect_004(stopFlag batchFlag);myGuiParms;parms;n;⎕TRAP;startDir;result
⍝ Exercise the "DirSelect" method. Allows creation and removal of directories.
 r←∆Failed
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')

 myGuiParms←#._APLGUI.GUI.APLGuiGlobalParms.CreateDefaults
 myGuiParms.regKey←'MyApp\Kai1'

 parms←#._APLGUI.GUI.DirSelect.CreateParms
 parms.addToCaption←'My request'
 parms.posn←45 35
 parms.fixDefaultDrive←1
 parms.info←'We need a directory for the installation of the software:'
 parms.allowCreate←1
 parms.allowRemove←1

 startDir←#.FilesAndDirs.GetTempFilename''
 1 ⎕NDELETE startDir
 'Create!'#.FilesAndDirs.CheckPath startDir  ⍝ Create a directory that does not contain a sub dir.
 n←myGuiParms parms #._APLGUI.GUI.DirSelect.Create startDir
 ⎕DL 0.1
 1 ⎕NQ n.Btn_01'Select'
 →GoToTidyUp~0∊⍴n.∆result
 r←∆OK

∆TidyUp:
 #.FilesAndDirs.RmDir startDir
 :Trap 6 ⋄ n.∆CloseForm ⋄ :EndTrap
